[{"text": "我要烤猪扒麻辣炒饭", "start": 49.823, "duration": 3.937}, {"text": "我快被你笑死", "start": 54.705, "duration": 1.935}, {"text": "很贵吗？", "start": 58.168, "duration": 0.996}, {"text": "嗯…13.95元", "start": 59.164, "duration": 2.66}, {"text": "可以点餐了", "start": 62.838, "duration": 1.482}, {"text": "要一个虾烧卖", "start": 64.482, "duration": 3.081}, {"text": "然后火龙果莓乌龙茶", "start": 70.895, "duration": 6.287}, {"text": "你要什么？", "start": 80.699, "duration": 1.413}, {"text": "一个越南咖啡", "start": 82.112, "duration": 2.88}, {"text": "好，谢谢", "start": 86.355, "duration": 1.801}, {"text": "这是火龙果莓乌龙茶", "start": 93.029, "duration": 3.099}, {"text": "他们餐点的份量比我想的还大一些", "start": 96.504, "duration": 4.788}, {"text": "吃完了！", "start": 126.504, "duration": 1.88}, {"text": "吃得好饱", "start": 128.68, "duration": 1.944}, {"text": "付小费的话是直接（付）现金吗？", "start": 142.347, "duration": 3.295}, {"text": "还是可以……?", "start": 145.642, "duration": 1.6}, {"text": "现金也可以，你用刷卡也可以", "start": 147.242, "duration": 2.752}, {"text": "好", "start": 149.994, "duration": 1.145}, {"text": "42.多少", "start": 163.264, "duration": 1.859}, {"text": "6吗", "start": 165.529, "duration": 1.709}, {"text": "已经刷了吗？", "start": 171.656, "duration": 1.551}, {"text": "不知道", "start": 173.207, "duration": 1.293}, {"text": "我们要签名，对不对？", "start": 177.955, "duration": 3.173}, {"text": "走吧！", "start": 196.025, "duration": 2.0}, {"text": "前面有Starbucks，而且它写星巴克", "start": 205.227, "duration": 3.17}, {"text": "这里（的店）都会加中文", "start": 208.397, "duration": 2.355}, {"text": "我觉得芝加哥天气真的非常好", "start": 215.977, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "你快趁现在多拍一点", "start": 219.411, "duration": 2.413}, {"text": "我们接下来要往哪走啊？", "start": 222.144, "duration": 2.892}, {"text": "我们在鬼混吗？", "start": 225.036, "duration": 1.546}, {"text": "对，我们现在在鬼混", "start": 226.582, "duration": 0.958}, {"text": "那就乱走啊", "start": 227.54, "duration": 1.553}, {"text": "可是这里也没有什么好鬼混的", "start": 229.093, "duration": 1.594}, {"text": "好像是喔", "start": 230.687, "duration": 0.732}, {"text": "欸那边", "start": 231.419, "duration": 1.061}, {"text": "好，那我们去那里坐一下", "start": 232.48, "duration": 2.272}, {"text": "欸我们是不是要买那个…", "start": 236.269, "duration": 1.576}, {"text": "我要买咖啡", "start": 237.845, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "哦对！你还要买", "start": 239.58, "duration": 0.976}, {"text": "好，那我们先走", "start": 240.556, "duration": 1.184}, {"text": "对，所以接下来就是要往…", "start": 241.74, "duration": 2.141}, {"text": "这怎么没办法放大", "start": 243.881, "duration": 3.289}, {"text": "放大！ ！放弃……", "start": 247.17, "duration": 3.134}, {"text": "我们去星巴克吧", "start": 251.429, "duration": 2.395}, {"text": "谢谢", "start": 268.885, "duration": 1.984}, {"text": "我要一杯拿铁", "start": 273.74, "duration": 1.859}, {"text": "什么大小", "start": 275.599, "duration": 1.164}, {"text": "中杯", "start": 277.161, "duration": 1.944}, {"text": "就这样吗？", "start": 281.913, "duration": 0.964}, {"text": "对，就这样", "start": 282.877, "duration": 0.972}, {"text": "芝加哥这边的建筑物都好高", "start": 299.489, "duration": 3.648}, {"text": "现在要去湖边散步", "start": 306.465, "duration": 3.016}, {"text": "嗨 Grace", "start": 313.697, "duration": 1.519}, {"text": "超可爱的！", "start": 315.216, "duration": 1.703}, {"text": "我第一次看海鸥欸", "start": 316.919, "duration": 1.973}, {"text": "海鸥", "start": 319.403, "duration": 1.124}, {"text": "对，近距离看他们", "start": 320.527, "duration": 3.362}, {"text": "这个喷泉好美啊", "start": 366.651, "duration": 2.514}, {"text": "来看有名的豆子", "start": 372.731, "duration": 2.885}, {"text": "在哪里?", "start": 384.584, "duration": 3.128}, {"text": "我跟我学姐现在在等开户", "start": 415.037, "duration": 2.883}, {"text": "我们昨天因为我睡太久", "start": 417.92, "duration": 2.379}, {"text": "所以我们来的时候银行就快关门了", "start": 420.299, "duration": 3.241}, {"text": "没有办法开户", "start": 423.54, "duration": 1.663}, {"text": "所以今天我们就预约最早的时间", "start": 425.203, "duration": 2.497}, {"text": "九点来开户", "start": 427.7, "duration": 0.965}, {"text": "现在Chase还是关的", "start": 428.665, "duration": 2.744}, {"text": "还有八分钟", "start": 431.409, "duration": 1.505}, {"text": "我们今天真的太早了", "start": 432.914, "duration": 1.318}, {"text": "欸，我真的很棒", "start": 434.232, "duration": 0.768}, {"text": "我今天六点多就起来了", "start": 435.0, "duration": 2.669}, {"text": "她根本没睡觉", "start": 437.669, "duration": 1.119}, {"text": "绝对不会迟到", "start": 438.788, "duration": 1.975}, {"text": "好啦，那我们就等一下开户，掰掰！", "start": 440.763, "duration": 3.167}, {"text": "我们办完啦！", "start": 456.24, "duration": 2.117}, {"text": "我们办了多久啊？", "start": 458.357, "duration": 3.147}, {"text": "三个小时", "start": 461.504, "duration": 2.304}, {"text": "但有六个人", "start": 463.808, "duration": 1.948}, {"text": "对，他三个小时办了六个人", "start": 465.756, "duration": 2.294}, {"text": "很快", "start": 468.05, "duration": 0.869}, {"text": "Eric 666", "start": 468.919, "duration": 2.806}, {"text": "可是我们全部都是讲中文欸", "start": 471.725, "duration": 2.535}, {"text": "对啊", "start": 474.26, "duration": 0.654}, {"text": "其实我觉得办银行户头还是很多东西要搞懂", "start": 474.914, "duration": 3.611}, {"text": "所以我们就决定要来Chinatown找会讲中文的专员", "start": 478.525, "duration": 4.515}, {"text": "之前有一个朋友说他是开一个小时", "start": 483.04, "duration": 2.599}, {"text": "一个人就开一个小时", "start": 485.639, "duration": 1.277}, {"text": "不知道大家都开多久，开户的话", "start": 486.916, "duration": 2.293}, {"text": "在台湾也差不多", "start": 489.209, "duration": 1.634}, {"text": "也要差不多一个小时", "start": 490.843, "duration": 1.666}, {"text": "差不多一个小时", "start": 492.509, "duration": 1.087}, {"text": "我之前开过两、三个小时的欸", "start": 493.596, "duration": 2.855}, {"text": "她…你怎么了", "start": 496.451, "duration": 2.158}, {"text": "是因为她是新的员工", "start": 498.609, "duration": 1.93}, {"text": "她在边做边学", "start": 500.539, "duration": 1.477}, {"text": "没错", "start": 502.016, "duration": 0.927}, {"text": "所以她就是常常做到一半", "start": 502.943, "duration": 1.555}, {"text": "他就会问其他人说，欸，这个部分要怎么做", "start": 504.498, "duration": 2.556}, {"text": "就特别久", "start": 507.054, "duration": 0.87}, {"text": "我们现在在等公车", "start": 507.924, "duration": 1.672}, {"text": "等一下要回去…休息吗？", "start": 509.596, "duration": 4.044}, {"text": "我们等一下要去吃蛋糕", "start": 513.64, "duration": 1.36}, {"text": "等一下要吃蛋糕，对", "start": 515.0, "duration": 1.012}, {"text": "等一下要吃cheese蛋糕", "start": 516.012, "duration": 1.717}, {"text": "先喝咖啡、吃蛋糕", "start": 517.729, "duration": 1.908}, {"text": "等一下要去星巴克", "start": 519.637, "duration": 1.033}, {"text": "先去星巴克买咖啡", "start": 520.67, "duration": 1.547}, {"text": "我们每天在这里都买星巴克", "start": 522.217, "duration": 1.549}, {"text": "我们到第三天", "start": 523.766, "duration": 1.621}, {"text": "三天都有买星巴克欸", "start": 525.387, "duration": 1.769}, {"text": "但这边星巴克跟台湾一样价格啊", "start": 527.156, "duration": 2.764}, {"text": "不买白不买啊", "start": 529.92, "duration": 1.077}, {"text": "相对来说感觉比较便宜", "start": 530.997, "duration": 1.995}, {"text": "便宜很多", "start": 532.992, "duration": 1.216}, {"text": "三倍的物价水准", "start": 534.208, "duration": 2.078}, {"text": "欸～麦当劳呢？", "start": 536.286, "duration": 1.698}, {"text": "麦当劳是…", "start": 537.984, "duration": 0.698}, {"text": "他们说麦当劳就差不多三倍", "start": 538.682, "duration": 2.039}, {"text": "所以麦当劳其实在台湾可能100块的…", "start": 540.721, "duration": 3.58}, {"text": "他们说在这边十块吧 麦当劳", "start": 544.301, "duration": 2.431}, {"text": "就是大概300块", "start": 546.732, "duration": 1.433}, {"text": "所以麦当劳是有差的", "start": 548.165, "duration": 2.043}, {"text": "星巴克真的是全球统一价", "start": 550.208, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "都一样…一样贵", "start": 553.408, "duration": 2.304}, {"text": "对", "start": 555.712, "duration": 0.703}, {"text": "加一些油", "start": 609.406, "duration": 2.521}, {"text": "先用蒜爆香", "start": 615.105, "duration": 3.369}, {"text": "菜弄好啦", "start": 651.906, "duration": 1.801}, {"text": "现在要等鸡腿肉", "start": 653.707, "duration": 3.432}, {"text": "完成！用气炸锅真的好方便", "start": 666.165, "duration": 3.792}, {"text": "在芝加哥的最后一餐", "start": 722.33, "duration": 2.667}, {"text": "这是芝加哥式热狗", "start": 724.997, "duration": 2.363}, {"text": "还有一些炸鸡、薯条", "start": 729.724, "duration": 3.529}, {"text": "要出发去印第安纳了", "start": 734.362, "duration": 3.268}, {"text": "你是打什么疫苗？", "start": 744.32, "duration": 2.792}, {"text": "莫德纳", "start": 747.112, "duration": 1.675}, {"text": "我们打Pfizer", "start": 748.787, "duration": 1.746}, {"text": "对，Pfizer", "start": 750.533, "duration": 1.143}, {"text": "然后打的那只手就非常地酸", "start": 751.676, "duration": 2.394}, {"text": "举不起来", "start": 754.07, "duration": 1.513}, {"text": "现在好多了", "start": 755.583, "duration": 2.337}, {"text": "又买了一杯咖啡", "start": 758.464, "duration": 2.216}, {"text": "这几天真的是靠咖啡因在调整我的时差 lol", "start": 760.68, "duration": 4.12}]